  "description": "Tamper-evident, zero-trust audit logging for Entity Framework Core. Every change is sealed into a per-table HMAC-SHA256 hash chain in the same transaction, with a signed head and anchors outside the database, so manipulation, even by database administrators, is cryptographically detectable. GDPR/KVKK redaction without breaking the chain, reasons and request metadata, incremental and offline verification, history and time travel, OpenTelemetry.",
